@NeerajSingh-jd9mv It depends on you. You can continue investing in SIP for as long as you want. You can also stop SIP and withdraw the amount whenever you wish to.

But some funds do have a lock-in period before which you cannot withdraw your money.

So it's always advisable to carefully check all the details of any fund before investing in it.

